invariant: INV-7
file: quic_config.c
catches: quic_driver_test
reason: ch_quic_init takes a configuration that names no original
  version, or one this build derives no keys for, and the session then
  derives Initial keys under a version the caller never named, which
  docs/decisions.md 79 rejects. test/quic_version_tests.h requires
  CH_EINVAL for 0, version 2 and two versions no RFC this build carries
  defines.

--- old
           cfg->transport_params_len <= CH_TRANSPORT_PARAMS_MAX && cfg->on_level_ready != NULL &&
           quic_version_derived(cfg->quic_original_version);
--- new
           cfg->transport_params_len <= CH_TRANSPORT_PARAMS_MAX && cfg->on_level_ready != NULL;
